        <mxCell id="rej_txt" value="&lt;b&gt;EKS&lt;/b&gt; — $73/mo idle control plane vs Fargate $0 (ADR-01)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;REST API&lt;/b&gt; — ≈ 3.5× cost → Pydantic + CloudFront-WAF (ADR-02)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Managed Grafana&lt;/b&gt; — $29/user/mo vs OSS ≈ $3 (ADR-05)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ElastiCache&lt;/b&gt; — dev uses per-task cache; Serverless Redis = prod path (ADR-03)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Interface endpoints&lt;/b&gt; — ≈ $64/mo &amp;gt; NAT $35 (ADR-04)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step Functions saga&lt;/b&gt; — orchestration overkill; choreography (ADR-06)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MSK / Kafka&lt;/b&gt; — SQS + EventBridge cover it at ≈ $0 baseline&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;x86 Fargate&lt;/b&gt; — ARM64 −20% (ADR-08); Spot evaluated for dev" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#1a1a2e;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="rej">
